 numbers at one vertex of an incidence graph view, its edge positions: a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stored or computed row, or a contiguous range. Random access,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"O(1) per element."}],"title":"IncidenceGraphView.IncidentEdgeIndices","identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/IncidenceGraphView\/IncidentEdgeIndices"}}}